+  oddRun(emptyOutput, INPUT),
+  vCons(noneV,.ValSeq)))
+```
+
+This is demonstrably false for the satisfying input `INPUT=.ValSeq`: execution
+returns `[]`, while the mutation demands `[None]`.
+
+The dry run:
