+
+All exited 0. Both JSON files have SHA-256
+`71b4ef4b97c417f330576f4fcb7cfa3e40bc6efb80ffb6b1bdb0ac9176935d96`
+(`evidence/stage4-identity-compare.log`). An earlier diagnostic in
